Package: hopd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${cargo:Depends}
Description: Hop Launcher daemon providing launcher IPC methods
 hopd serves Unix-socket IPC methods used by Hop Launcher frontends.
 It supports utility intent execution and health/metrics endpoints.
 This package also ships the kde-hopd-query adapter helper CLI.
